              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-46604",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-46604\nSeverity: UNKNOWN\nPackage: golang.org/x/image\nFixed Version: 0.43.0\nLink: [CVE-2026-46604](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-46604)\nThe TIFF decoder can panic when decoding an invalid image with an out-of-bounds strip offset.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-46604**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|UNKNOWN|golang.org/x/image|0.43.0|[CVE-2026-46604](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-46604)|\n\nThe TIFF decoder can panic when decoding an invalid image with an out-of-bounds strip offset."
              },
